<title>UK: Watmoughs shares hit by profit warning.</title>
<headline>Watmoughs shares hit by profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British printing group Watmoughs (Holdings) Plc dropped sharply after the company said it was unlikely that its first-half profits would match the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>Watmoughs shares dropped to a new year's low of 310p immediately after the warning but pared losses to trade at 322-1/2p, down 37-1/2p on the day. Over 94,000 shares had changed hands.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
